# Test / build artifacts
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/*.user

# Offline bundle: SDK installer + saved image tars + isolated restore caches (multi-GB — NEVER send
# to the docker daemon as build context). NOTE: nugets/ is intentionally NOT ignored — the Dockerfiles
# COPY it for the offline restore.
offline-bundle/

# Tests (not needed for runtime image)
tests/

# Git + planning
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.planning/

# Docs (not needed for runtime image)
*.md
README.md

# Compose runtime config (not needed inside the service container)
compose/
compose.yaml
.env*

# IDE
.vscode/
